# Changelog
All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

This project uses semantic versioning. Versions below 1.0.0
represent active conceptual development and manifesto-stage articulation.

---

## [0.4.0] — 2025-03-03
### Status
Public manifesto / foundational draft

### Added
- Explicit Jungian analytical psychology foundation
- Resonance defined as a functional cognitive operator
- Indisciplinary positioning statement
- Early structural articles and definitions
- Initial ethical framing of competence and interdependency

### Clarified
- Distinction between symbolic method and metaphysical claim
- Role of myth and archetype in psychological infrastructure
- Non-claims regarding cosmology, theology, or supernatural assertion

### Notes
This version represents a public-facing manifesto and conceptual foundation.
It is **not** a thesis submission version.

